  "description": "openEHR Operational Template parser and concrete OperationalTemplate\n      model for .NET. Reads both OPT2 (ADL2-text via Opt2Parser, on top of\n      the ADL2 parser from DotnetOpenEhr.Archetypes) and OPT1.4 (XML via\n      Opt14XmlParser, the format every authoring tool emits — CKM, Better\n      Studio, EHRbase, openFHIR KDS). Both parsers return the same\n      OperationalTemplate, so the ITemplateSchema seam consumed by the\n      template-aware FLAT serializer and the validator works uniformly\n      across formats. Trim-safe and Native-AOT-safe. Single TFM net10.0.",
